  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5.8’ bed of 2014-2019 Chevrolet Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500.. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2014-2018 Chevy Silverado / GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\nFeatures\nGreat Fit:\nReliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to\nensure precise compatibility with the 5.8’ bed of 2014 2015 2016 2017\n2018 Chevrolet Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500(DO NOT FIT Multi-flex\ntailgate).\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of\nthe side rails keep the cover close tightly; sturdy clamps and buckles\nwith straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your\ntruck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
